        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweasa fuga Israeli iita muy bea ng'eanyiita ghayi gwalsa ghaang'iin, ak gwayeesha, “Ng'eanyiidida ghayi sisikchi jeeda eegwalsiina ghaang'iin, ng'eanyiida aga fuga mida jeeda; nea buuneesean sideaksi jeeda ea fuga geawi muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
