        {
          "text": "Ak aba hoowa geadaayi eemeeda Nefili, was orjooga Anaki, was fuga rinna jeedeaba fiisu bea Nefiliin; ak geeng'ulayi geat ak geewuurjeewi dakajeega; ak eara saawa ea gitaaktaneasa.”",
